  "implementation": [
    "Recommendation provider input maps to cloudProvider; response provider reads cloudProvider.",
    "Recommendations use maxResults/pageToken and return pagination.pageToken. Numeric page 0 remains accepted; nonzero pages fail with cursor migration guidance. pageSize remains an alias; maxResults wins. The tool retains its advertised default of 20.",
    "Category accepts a single value or a legacy array of at most one value. Multiple categories fail validation.",
    "easyWin follows the verified API predicate easyWinDescription != empty string; missing description returns null. The description is also returned.",
    "Resource pages accept maxResults (1\u20135000, default 1000) and pageToken and preserve resourceResults/rowCount/pageToken.",
    "Anomaly detail preserves all API fields, including resourceData, actualCost, expectedMaxCost and allocations, while retaining ISO date formatting.",
    "Alert PATCH config and all its fields are optional; only supplied fields are sent. Create requires operator; both create and update reject hour, accept the API condition/dataSource enums, and permit omitted scope mode without inserting defaults.",
    "Budget name filtering sends nameContains to the API before pagination.",
    "Incident platform constraints are sent in filter; legacy google-cloud-project input is normalized. Only AWS and Google Cloud are advertised. The endpoint-specific parser allows one repeated key for OR and rejects conflicting platform constraints. Empty pages retain their cursor.",
    "Descriptions cover title-only search, page-local savings ordering, all-status defaults, easyWin false, lookup caps and ambiguity, deprecated insight-status writes and dismissal reason, alert defaults/limits, and budget owner-filter and conditional-write requirements."
  ],
