    "Hosted OAuth and live switched-customer behavior were not exercised. Deterministic context propagation tests cover the shared handler path, not OAuth itself.",
    "The first sampled insight had an empty resource page without a cursor, and active Google Cloud incidents had no next page. Continuation was subsequently verified on an actionable insight and archived incidents.",
    "The dedicated insight-status endpoint validates five user statuses and requires a dismissal reason; the metadata-post endpoint keeps its existing wider status schema. No insight writes were performed."
